// What this plugin ships as instruction, and what in the record asks for it.
//
// Declared by TS.260821.03. Before this file, the record described the WORK — slices,
// commitments, claims, releases — and never the doctrine shipped to do the work. Twenty-two
// of the forty-seven skills correspond to a slice this frame delivered; the rest correspond
// to nothing, and could not be shown to, because there was no node to hang the edge on.
//
// This file holds only the anchored half. Deciding the rest is TS.260821.04, and keeping the
// two apart is what makes `unanchored` a measurement rather than a list produced by whoever
// did the deleting.

doctrine-surface "surface.skill.using-praxis" {
    path "skills/using-praxis/SKILL.md"
    kind "skill"
    serves "multi-harness-distribution"
    note "corrected by TS.260821.08. It served the FRAME, which is the root: every surface \
        descends from it, so the anchor discriminated nothing. The real owner was in the record \
        the whole time — multi-harness-distribution owns the event RouterInjected, and this file \
        is the artifact that event injects"
}

